{"id":"npc:%E5%8D%A2%E6%AF%94%E5%A5%A5%E4%B9%8B%E5%A5%B3","profile":[{"title":"人物简介","text":"卢比奥的女儿。被卢比奥托付给了拉维妮娅。","spoiler":true,"source":"活动剧情IS-9 文明的谎言、IS-ST-3 剜刺等"}],"artCandidates":[{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_npc_700_1$1.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/2/2a/Avg_avg_npc_700_1$1.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_700_1$1.png"}],"appearances":[{"story":"activities/act21side/level_act21side_st03","lineCount":34,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":17,"line":18,"speaker":"卢比奥之女","text":"啊，真的是法官阁下！"},{"commandIndex":95,"line":96,"speaker":"卢比奥之女","text":"我看过几次，上面写的都是些无聊的东西，要我说呀，就是一本活脱脱的中年男人生活实录，枯燥又冗长。"},{"commandIndex":768,"line":769,"speaker":"卢比奥之女","text":"不，父亲……他有危险！"}]},{"story":"activities/act21side/level_act21side_09_beg","lineCount":6,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":435,"line":436,"speaker":"卢比奥之女","text":"父亲……他……呜……"},{"commandIndex":446,"line":447,"speaker":"卢比奥之女","text":"就、就算是我也能感觉到，父亲这么做，城里接下来肯定一片混乱。"},{"commandIndex":447,"line":448,"speaker":"卢比奥之女","text":"您也和我一起躲起来吧。"}]}]}